<title>BANGLADESH: Bangladesh Chittagong Cement 1995 profit up 78 pct.</title>
<headline>Bangladesh Chittagong Cement 1995 profit up 78 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The year ended on June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>	  (In million taka unless stated)</p>
<p>			    1995/96	    1994/95</p>
<p>    Net profit	  87.2	vs     49.0</p>
<p>    Profit before tax 134.3     vs     71.7</p>
<p>    Gross profit	160.3     vs     91.6</p>
<p>    Sales		 813.9     vs     538.5</p>
<p>    Dividend    20 taka on 100-taka share vs 30 taka.</p>
<p>Note - The Chittagong Cement Clinker Grinding Ltd, which announced the annual results on Thursday, said the porfit rose sharply as it's sales shot up because of the booming construction sector. It also offered one-for-two bonus share and one rights shares against two shares held by the investors.</p>
</text>
